    ["practice_vita_health_power_knack"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to enhance your overall health.\n\nPower Difficulty: 1\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_health_power_knack>",
    ["practice_vita_hurt_touch"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to induce decay.\n\nPower Difficulty: 3\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_hurt_touch>",
    ["practice_vita_limb_restore"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to restore whole limbs, but at an extreme cost.\n\nPower Difficulty: 10\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_limb_restore>",
    ["practice_vita_no_need_for_sleep"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to sleep while remaining awake.\n\nPower Difficulty: 7\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_no_need_for_sleep>",
    ["practice_vita_purge_rads"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to remove radiation from your body.\n\nPower Difficulty: 6\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_purge_rads>",
    ["practice_vita_remove_poison"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to sweat out any dangerous toxins.\n\nPower Difficulty: 3\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_remove_poison>",
    ["practice_vita_remove_poison_knack"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to sweat out any dangerous toxins.\n\nPower Difficulty: 2\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_remove_poison_knack>",
    ["practice_vita_return_from_death"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to keep yourself alive in the event of a near-death experience.\n\nPower Difficulty: 10\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_return_from_death>",
    ["practice_vita_sleeping_trance"] = "Contemplate your powers and develop your ability to forego sleep in favor of meditation.\n\nPower Difficulty: 4\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_sleeping_trance>",
    ["practice_vita_slow_bleeding"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to slow your rate of bleeding.\n\nPower Difficulty: 1\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_slow_bleeding>",
    ["practice_vita_stop_bleeding"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to stop bleeding.\n\nPower Difficulty: 2\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_stop_bleeding>",
    ["practice_vita_stop_infection"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to use your powers to disinfect.\n\nPower Difficulty: 5\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_stop_infection>",
    ["practice_vita_super_heal"] = "Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to heal unbelievably quickly, but at a cost.\n\nPower Difficulty: 9\n\nCurrent Power Level: <u_spell_level:vita_super_heal>",
    ["psi_centering_meditation_drain_reduce"] = "Through practice, you've learned how to calm and focus yourself during meditation.  If you meditated properly, you could channel the additional nether energy you have accumulated out into your surroundings, though doing so will be extremely tiring.  It will also help shield you from nether energies for a short time afterwards.",
    ["psi_centering_meditation_drain_reduce_heart_of_fire"] = "By gazing into the flames, you can reduce your exposure to the energies of the Nether.",
    ["psi_matrix_channeling_drain_reduce"] = "That report indicated there was a way to channel the additional nether energy from long-term psionic use into a focusing object.  All you need is a drained matrix crystal and time.",
    ["psi_noetic_resonance_detector_usage"] = "Follow the usage instructions of the noetic resonance detector to determine your \"noetic potential\".",
    ["psi_research_extended_channeling"] = "There has to be an easier way of evoking your powers than frantically concentrating and trying to get the energies out.  Maybe if you took more time, you wouldn't have to concentrate so hard?  It wouldn't help you when a zombie was trying to eat you but it would definitely be useful otherwise.",
    ["psi_research_rad_powers"] = "Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB.  It has something to do with radiation; beyond that, you're not sure.",
    ["psi_research_rad_powers_clair"] = "Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB relating to RED SAFARI.  It has something to do with radiation detection; beyond that, you're not sure.",
    ["psi_research_rad_powers_vita"] = "Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB relating to HONEY BRAVO.  It has something to do with radiation treatment; beyond that, you're not sure.",
    ["psi_research_torrential_channeling"] = "You have more of an understanding of the way the Nether ebbs and flows, sometimes surging forth like a flood when you least expect it.  There has to be a way to direct that more purposefully, to call forth more energy than you need and direct it into your powers instead of letting it wash over you.  It might be risky, sure, but you need every edge you can get in this post-Cataclysmic world.",
  },
}
